# ============================================================
# UI style — đổi diện mạo public site mà không động code
# ============================================================
# Values:
#   cypher-2049   — Blade Runner 2049 × cypherpunk: amber dust + Joi pink, kanji billboards, glitch headline, CCTV scope chrome. Mặc định.
#   terminal      — dev/hacker terminal: all-mono, scanlines, phosphor green, ASCII frames, dark default.
#   neo-brutalist — bold flat colors, thick borders, hard offset shadows, chunky display sans, pop yellow accent.
# Sai giá trị thì fallback về "cypher-2049".
